按小柚泡泡裡的麥克風、或 Super+Shift+V，說完停一下就會自動送出。聲音只在這台電腦上辨識，辨識完就刪掉，不會傳到網路上。	Press the microphone in Pomi's bubble or Super+Shift+V, and pause briefly when done to send. Your voice is recognized only on this computer, deleted right after, and never sent to the internet.
