輕點 Shift 或按 Ctrl+空白鍵 切換輸入法／英文，Ctrl+Shift+空白鍵 換下一個輸入法；選單列右側會顯示目前的輸入法（注、한…），點它也可以切換。不用 fcitx 或 ibus。	Tap Shift or press Ctrl+Space to switch between the input method and English; Ctrl+Shift+Space switches to the next input method. The current input method (注, 한…) is shown on the right of the menu bar; click it to switch too. No fcitx or ibus needed.
拼音、倉頡、速成、粵拼使用 Rime（中州韻）引擎，字典從網路下載；第一次使用要先花十幾秒整理字典。	Pinyin, Cangjie, Quick and Jyutping use the Rime engine; their dictionaries are downloaded from the internet, and the first use takes about 15 seconds to prepare them.
