「符合視窗」會請 Windows 把解析度改成視窗的大小，拉視窗時跟著變。連線後按 Ctrl+Alt+Enter 切換全螢幕。頻寬越窄，桌布、視窗動畫、佈景主題這些效果會自動關掉，連線比較不卡。	"Fit window" asks Windows to change the resolution to the window size and follows when you resize. Press Ctrl+Alt+Enter after connecting to toggle full screen. The narrower the bandwidth, the more effects like wallpaper, window animations and themes get turned off automatically so the connection stays smooth.
