⚠ 硬體虛擬化（KVM）沒有啟用：虛擬機器還是能跑，但會慢很多。可能是 BIOS 裡的 Intel VT-x／AMD-V 沒有開。	⚠ Hardware virtualization (KVM) is not enabled: virtual machines still run, but much more slowly. Intel VT-x/AMD-V may be turned off in the BIOS.
⚠ 這台電腦沒有硬體虛擬化（KVM），或是本身就是虛擬機器：虛擬機器還是能跑，但會慢很多。	⚠ This computer has no hardware virtualization (KVM), or is itself a virtual machine: virtual machines still run, but much more slowly.
