Windows 11 需要 UEFI、安全開機與 TPM 2.0（已經幫你打開）。Windows 沒有 VirtIO 驅動程式，所以硬碟用 SATA、網路卡用 Intel e1000e。	Windows 11 needs UEFI, Secure Boot and TPM 2.0 (already turned on for you). Windows has no VirtIO drivers, so the disk uses SATA and the network card uses Intel e1000e.
一般選 UEFI 就好；很舊的系統（例如 32 位元）才需要傳統 BIOS。	UEFI is usually fine; only very old systems (such as 32-bit ones) need Legacy BIOS.
