不接網路	No Network
UEFI（安全開機）	UEFI (Secure Boot)
有儲存的狀態時不能改設定（硬體不一樣就繼續不了）。要改設定，先「繼續」再關機，或捨棄儲存的狀態。	Settings can’t be changed while there is a saved state (it couldn’t resume on different hardware). To change settings, click “Resume” and then shut down, or discard the saved state.
關機後才能修改設定。光碟可以在畫面視窗上面的「光碟」換。	Settings can be changed after shutting down. You can change the disc from “CD/DVD” at the top of the display window.
NAT（跟這台電腦共用網路）	NAT (share this computer’s network)
橋接（跟這台電腦在同一個區域網路）	Bridged (on the same local network as this computer)
連線方式	Connection Type
轉送連接埠	Port Forwarding
轉送連接埠寫成「本機:虛擬機器」，例如 2222:22 之後可以用 ssh -p 2222 localhost 連進虛擬機器（只有這台電腦連得到）。	Write forwarded ports as “this computer:virtual machine”. For example, with 2222:22 you can connect to the virtual machine with ssh -p 2222 localhost (only this computer can connect).
橋接器	Bridge
找不到 qemu-bridge-helper	qemu-bridge-helper not found
要先允許虛擬機器使用 %s	Virtual machines must first be allowed to use %s
允許使用	Allow
允許使用橋接器	Allow Using the Bridge
橋接時虛擬機器像網路上的另一台電腦，從路由器拿 IP，區域網路裡的其他電腦也連得到它。「允許使用」會把橋接器寫進 /etc/qemu/bridge.conf，並讓 qemu-bridge-helper 能以管理員權限建立網路介面。	When bridged, the virtual machine acts like another computer on the network: it gets an IP from the router, and other computers on the local network can reach it. “Allow” adds the bridge to /etc/qemu/bridge.conf and lets qemu-bridge-helper create network interfaces with administrator rights.
這台電腦還沒有橋接器（可以用有線網路卡 %s 建一個）	This computer has no bridge yet (you can create one with the wired network card %s)
建立橋接器	Create Bridge
會建立橋接器 br0，把有線網路卡接上去，這台電腦的網路會中斷幾秒、IP 可能會變。按 Enter 繼續，Ctrl+C 取消。	This creates the bridge br0 and connects the wired network card to it. This computer’s network will drop for a few seconds and its IP may change. Press Enter to continue, Ctrl+C to cancel.
建立橋接器要用 NetworkManager，只能用有線網路卡（Wi-Fi 沒辦法橋接）。如果是遠端連進這台電腦，建立時連線會中斷一下。	Creating a bridge requires NetworkManager and only works with a wired network card (Wi-Fi can’t be bridged). If you’re connected to this computer remotely, the connection will drop briefly while it’s created.
沒有可以橋接的網路卡	No network card that can be bridged
Wi-Fi 網路卡沒辦法橋接，請用 NAT。	Wi-Fi network cards can’t be bridged; use NAT instead.
ARM64（軟體模擬）	ARM64 (software emulation)
光碟機	CD/DVD Drive
沒有光碟	No Disc
硬碟優先	Hard Disk First
光碟優先	CD/DVD First
開機順序	Boot Order
硬碟優先時，硬碟還沒裝系統會自動從光碟開機，裝好之後就從硬碟開，不用再改。	With “Hard Disk First”, the virtual machine starts from the CD/DVD while nothing is installed on the hard disk yet, and from the hard disk once a system is installed, so there’s no need to change it.
%s（實際佔用 %s）	%s (%s actually used)
讀不到硬碟檔	Could not read the disk file
不變	No Change
加大硬碟	Enlarge Disk
加大	Enlarge
顯示與聲音	Display & Sound
標準 VGA（相容性最好）	Standard VGA (most compatible)
VirtIO（解析度可以跟著視窗）	VirtIO (resolution can match the window)
麥克風要另外安裝 QEMU 的聲音模組	The microphone needs QEMU’s audio module to be installed
虛擬機器的聲音從這台電腦的喇叭播出，麥克風也可以用。	The virtual machine’s sound plays through this computer’s speakers, and the microphone works too.
虛擬機器的聲音透過畫面視窗播出（畫面視窗開著才聽得到），沒有麥克風。要用麥克風請安裝 QEMU 的聲音模組（qemu-system-gui，會一起裝 GTK3，約 30 MB）。	The virtual machine’s sound plays through the display window (you only hear it while the display window is open), with no microphone. To use a microphone, install QEMU’s audio module (qemu-system-gui, which also installs GTK3, about 30 MB).
韌體與安全	Firmware & Security
切換安全開機會換一套 UEFI 韌體，UEFI 裡的開機選項會回到預設。	Turning Secure Boot on or off switches to a different UEFI firmware, and the boot options in UEFI go back to their defaults.
含記憶體（回去時程式都還開著）	With memory (programs are still open when you go back)
只有硬碟	Disk only
回到這個快照	Restore this snapshot
要先關機	Shut down first
要先捨棄儲存的狀態	Discard the saved state first
回到這個快照（現在的狀態會不見）	Restore this snapshot (the current state will be lost)
回到這個快照並開機	Restore this snapshot and start
回到這個快照（硬碟會變回當時的樣子）	Restore this snapshot (the disk goes back to how it was then)
刪除這個快照	Delete this snapshot
請稍候…	Please wait…
正在拍快照	Taking a snapshot
處理中	Processing
把現在的樣子（含記憶體）存成一個快照	Save the current state (including memory) as a snapshot
把現在的硬碟存成一個快照	Save the current disk as a snapshot
快照存在硬碟檔裡，隨時可以回到拍的時候。執行中拍的連記憶體一起存，要拍久一點。	Snapshots are stored in the disk file, and you can go back to one at any time. Snapshots taken while running also save memory and take a little longer.
使用量	Usage
%s／配置 %s	%s of %s allocated
磁碟　讀 %s　寫 %s　（最高 %s）	Disk   Read %s   Write %s   (peak %s)
讀取	Read
寫入	Write
網路　下載 %s　上傳 %s　（最高 %s）	Network   Down %s   Up %s   (peak %s)
上傳	Upload
記憶體是 QEMU 實際佔用的（虛擬機器用過的才算）。NAT 的網路只算 TCP，是概略的數字。	Memory is what QEMU actually uses (only memory the virtual machine has touched counts). With NAT, network traffic counts only TCP, so it is approximate.
記憶體是 QEMU 實際佔用的（虛擬機器用過的才算）。	Memory is what QEMU actually uses (only memory the virtual machine has touched counts).
正在開機…	Starting…
顯示虛擬機器的畫面	Show the virtual machine’s display
顯示畫面	Show Display
暫停（記憶體留著，隨時可以繼續）	Pause (memory is kept, so you can continue any time)
請虛擬機器關機（像按一下電源鍵）	Ask the virtual machine to shut down (like pressing the power button)
