安裝 Docker	Install Docker
這台電腦還沒有安裝 Docker	Docker isn’t installed on this computer yet
會開一個終端機視窗安裝（要輸入你的密碼）：加上 Docker 官方的套件庫，安裝 Docker 並設定開機自動執行，再把你加進 docker 群組。裝好後要登出再登入。	A terminal window will open to install it (you’ll need your password): it adds Docker’s official repository, installs Docker, sets it to start automatically, and adds you to the docker group. Log out and back in when it’s done.
會開一個終端機視窗安裝（要輸入你的密碼）：安裝系統內建的 Docker 並設定開機自動執行，再把你加進 docker 群組。裝好後要登出再登入。	A terminal window will open to install it (you’ll need your password): it installs the Docker package that comes with your system, sets it to start automatically, and adds you to the docker group. Log out and back in when it’s done.
Docker 沒有在執行	Docker isn’t running
