加入 docker 群組	Join the docker Group
加入 docker 群組後要登出再登入才會生效。注意：docker 群組的成員可以透過容器取得整台電腦的管理員權限，只加信任的帳號。	Joining the docker group takes effect after you log out and back in. Note: members of the docker group can get full administrator rights on this computer through containers, so only add accounts you trust.
