會備份容器的設定、資料卷與掛載資料夾裡的檔案；連映像一起的話，容器裡改過的東西也都在。執行中的容器備份時會暫停一下。	Backs up the container’s settings and the files in its volumes and mounted folders. With the image included, any changes made inside the container are kept too. A running container is briefly paused during the backup.
