映像例如 nginx、mariadb:11；這台電腦還沒有的會先下載。	Image, e.g. nginx or mariadb:11. If it isn’t on this computer yet, it’s downloaded first.
連接與資料	Connections and Data
連接埠	Ports
指令（可留空）	Command (optional)
連接埠寫「本機:容器」，例如 8080:80（用逗號分開多個）。資料夾寫「本機路徑或資料卷名稱:容器裡的路徑」，例如 ~/網站:/usr/share/nginx/html、db:/var/lib/mysql。環境變數用分號分開，例如 TZ=Asia/Taipei; MARIADB_ROOT_PASSWORD=密碼。	Write ports as “computer:container”, e.g. 8080:80 (separate several with commas). Write folders as “local path or volume name:path in the container”, e.g. ~/website:/usr/share/nginx/html or db:/var/lib/mysql. Separate environment variables with semicolons, e.g. TZ=Asia/Taipei; MARIADB_ROOT_PASSWORD=password.
