電池健康度 %.0f%%	Battery health %.0f%%
充飽時只能存原本容量的 %.0f%%%s。	When fully charged, it holds only %.0f%% of its original capacity%s.
，用電時間會比新的時候短	, so it won't last as long as when it was new
充放電 %ld 次。	Charge cycles: %ld.
目前電量 %ld%%（%s）。	Current charge: %ld%% (%s).
充電中	charging
用電池	on battery
已充飽	fully charged
沒在充電	not charging
電池老化了；用電時間太短的話可以考慮換電池。	The battery has aged. If it doesn't last long enough, consider replacing it.
讀不到電池的設計容量，無法判斷健康度	Can't read the battery's design capacity, so its health can't be determined
目前電量 %ld%%。	Current charge: %ld%%.
已充到設定的上限，暫停充電（保護電池）	Reached the set charge limit; charging paused (to protect the battery)
插著電，但電池沒有在充電	Plugged in, but the battery isn't charging
檢查變壓器與插頭；變壓器功率不夠時也會這樣。	Check the power adapter and plug. This also happens if the adapter isn't powerful enough.
電池會一直充到 100%	The battery always charges to 100%
這台筆電支援設定充電上限；常常插著電使用的話，設成 80% 可以讓電池老化得慢一點。	This laptop supports a charge limit. If it's usually plugged in, setting it to 80% helps the battery age more slowly.
充電上限設在 %ld%%	Charge limit set to %ld%%
這台電腦沒有電池	This computer has no battery
這台電腦	This computer
CPU：%s（%ld 執行緒）	CPU: %s (%ld threads)
記憶體：%s	Memory: %s
沒有驅動	no driver
顯示卡有用上驅動	The graphics card is using a driver
NVIDIA 顯示卡用的是開源驅動；玩遊戲或用 CUDA 的話可以從 RPM Fusion 安裝 NVIDIA 官方驅動。	The NVIDIA graphics card is using the open-source driver. For gaming or CUDA, you can install the official NVIDIA driver from RPM Fusion.
NVIDIA 顯示卡用的是開源驅動；玩遊戲或用 CUDA 的話可以安裝 NVIDIA 官方驅動（終端機：sudo ubuntu-drivers install）。	The NVIDIA graphics card is using the open-source driver. For gaming or CUDA, you can install the official NVIDIA driver (in Terminal: sudo ubuntu-drivers install).
這是虛擬機器（%s），畫面用軟體畫	This is a virtual machine (%s); the screen is drawn in software
顯示卡沒有用上驅動，畫面是用 CPU 畫的	The graphics card has no driver in use; the screen is drawn by the CPU
畫面會比較慢、比較耗電，影片也可能不順。	The display will be slower and use more power, and videos may stutter.
安裝顯示卡的驅動或韌體（見下面缺少韌體那一項）；新的顯示卡可能要更新的核心才認得。	Install the graphics driver or firmware (see the missing firmware item below). Newer graphics cards may need a newer kernel to be recognized.
有 %d 個裝置沒有驅動	%d device(s) without a driver
用方括號裡的編號上網搜尋「Linux 驅動」；Wi-Fi 網卡常常只是缺韌體。	Search online for the ID in square brackets plus “Linux driver”. Wi-Fi cards are often just missing firmware.
重要的裝置都有驅動	All important devices have drivers
缺少 %d 個韌體檔	%d firmware file(s) missing
安裝 firmware-linux-nonfree（要先在套件來源加上 non-free-firmware）。	Install firmware-linux-nonfree (add non-free-firmware to your package sources first).
安裝或更新 linux-firmware 套件（sudo dnf install linux-firmware）。	Install or update the linux-firmware package (sudo dnf install linux-firmware).
更新 linux-firmware 套件（sudo apt install linux-firmware）。	Update the linux-firmware package (sudo apt install linux-firmware).
USB 裝置常常連線失敗	USB devices often fail to connect
本次開機以來出現 %d 次 USB 錯誤。	%d USB error(s) since the computer started.
換一個 USB 孔或換一條線；耗電大的裝置（外接硬碟）可以改用有外接電源的 USB 集線器。	Try another USB port or cable. For power-hungry devices (external hard drives), use a USB hub with its own power supply.
找不到音效卡	No sound card found
沒有喇叭或耳機輸出；可能是缺驅動或韌體（見上面），虛擬機器則要在設定裡加音效裝置。	There's no speaker or headphone output. A driver or firmware may be missing (see above); for a virtual machine, add a sound device in its settings.
有音效卡，但聲音系統找不到輸出	There's a sound card, but the sound system can't find an output
登出再登入一次；還是不行的話，在音效設定看看輸出裝置。	Log out and back in. If that doesn't help, check the output device in Sound settings.
開啟音效設定	Open Sound settings
有聲音輸出	Sound output is available
有音效卡	Sound card found
%d 顆硬碟的健康狀態有警告	Health warning on %d drive(s)
請盡快備份重要的檔案，考慮換硬碟。	Back up important files as soon as possible and consider replacing the drive.
開啟儲存空間	Open Storage
硬碟健康狀態正常	Drive health is OK
網路服務（NetworkManager）沒有在執行	The network service (NetworkManager) isn't running
沒有它就不能連線、也不能切換 Wi-Fi。	Without it, you can't connect or switch Wi-Fi networks.
啟動網路服務	Start network service
網路服務正常執行中	The network service is running normally
這台電腦沒有用 NetworkManager，只檢查連線	This computer doesn't use NetworkManager; only the connection is checked
Wi-Fi 被硬體開關關掉了	Wi-Fi is turned off by a hardware switch
打開筆電上的無線網路開關，或按鍵盤上有天線圖示的功能鍵（通常要配合 Fn）。	Turn on the wireless switch on your laptop, or press the function key with the antenna icon (usually together with Fn).
Wi-Fi 關著（可能是飛航模式）	Wi-Fi is off (maybe airplane mode)
打開 Wi-Fi	Turn on Wi-Fi
網路線沒有接上（%s）	Network cable not connected (%s)
檢查網路線兩端有沒有插好；換一個路由器上的插孔或換一條線試試。	Check that both ends of the cable are plugged in firmly. Try another port on the router or another cable.
沒有連上任何網路	Not connected to any network
在網路設定選一個 Wi-Fi，或插上網路線。	Choose a Wi-Fi network in Network settings, or plug in a network cable.
插上網路線；這台電腦沒有 Wi-Fi 網路卡。	Plug in a network cable. This computer has no Wi-Fi card.
開啟網路設定	Open Network settings
沒有連線，略過 IP、路由器、DNS、網際網路的檢查	Not connected; skipping the IP, router, DNS and internet checks
已連上 Wi-Fi	Connected to Wi-Fi
已連上有線網路	Connected to a wired network
有線網路：%s	Wired network: %s
Wi-Fi 訊號良好（%d%%）	Wi-Fi signal is good (%d%%)
Wi-Fi 訊號普通（%d%%）	Wi-Fi signal is fair (%d%%)
網路慢的時候，可以靠近路由器一點。	If the network is slow, move a little closer to the router.
Wi-Fi 訊號弱（%d%%）	Wi-Fi signal is weak (%d%%)
訊號弱會讓網路變慢、斷斷續續。	A weak signal makes the network slow and unreliable.
靠近路由器、避開牆壁與金屬，或改用 5 GHz 的網路、有線網路。	Move closer to the router and away from walls and metal, or switch to a 5 GHz network or a wired connection.
「%s」沒有加密	“%s” is not encrypted
同一個 Wi-Fi 上的人可能看得到你沒有加密的連線內容。	People on the same Wi-Fi may be able to see your unencrypted traffic.
公共場所盡量只開 https 的網站，或使用 VPN；自己家裡的路由器請設定 WPA2 或 WPA3 密碼。	In public places, stick to https websites or use a VPN. On your own router at home, set a WPA2 or WPA3 password.
「%s」用的是 WEP 加密，幾分鐘就能被破解	“%s” uses WEP encryption, which can be cracked in minutes
把路由器改成 WPA2 或 WPA3。	Switch the router to WPA2 or WPA3.
「%s」用的是舊的 WPA 加密	“%s” uses old WPA encryption
Wi-Fi 有加密（%s）	Wi-Fi is encrypted (%s)
附近有 %d 個 Wi-Fi 跟你用同一個頻道（%d）	%d nearby Wi-Fi network(s) on the same channel as you (%d)
2.4 GHz 很擁擠；路由器有 5 GHz 的話改連 5 GHz，或在路由器把頻道改成自動。	2.4 GHz is crowded. If your router has 5 GHz, connect to that instead, or set the router's channel to automatic.
沒有拿到 IP 位址	No IP address
只有 169.254 開頭的位址：路由器沒有回應自動分配（DHCP）的要求。	Only an address starting with 169.254: the router didn't answer the request for an automatic address (DHCP).
網路卡連上了，但還沒有 IP 位址。	The network card is connected but doesn't have an IP address yet.
先試著重新連線；還是不行就重新啟動路由器。	Try reconnecting first. If that doesn't help, restart the router.
沒有 IP 位址，略過路由器、DNS、網際網路的檢查	No IP address; skipping the router, DNS and internet checks
IP 位址：%s	IP address: %s
網路卡：%s	Network card: %s
沒有預設路由器（閘道）	No default router (gateway)
有 IP 位址，但不知道要從哪裡出去上網；通常是手動設定少填了路由器。	There's an IP address, but no way out to the internet. Usually the router was left out of a manual setup.
路由器（%s）沒有回應 ping	Router (%s) doesn't respond to ping
有些路由器會關掉 ping，不一定是問題；請看下面能不能上網。	Some routers turn off ping, so this isn't necessarily a problem. See below whether the internet works.
連到路由器時掉了 %d%% 的封包	%d%% of packets to the router were lost
路由器 %s，平均 %.0f 毫秒。	Router %s, average %.0f ms.
Wi-Fi 受到干擾或訊號不好；靠近路由器，或改用有線網路。	The Wi-Fi has interference or a poor signal. Move closer to the router or use a wired connection.
檢查網路線與路由器的插孔。	Check the network cable and the router port.
連到路由器很慢（平均 %.0f 毫秒）	The router is slow to respond (average %.0f ms)
正常應該在 10 毫秒以內；可能是 Wi-Fi 擁擠或路由器太忙，試著重新啟動路由器。	Normally it should be under 10 ms. The Wi-Fi may be crowded or the router too busy; try restarting the router.
路由器回應正常（%s，%.0f 毫秒）	Router responds normally (%s, %.0f ms)
DNS 查不到網址（網路本身是通的）	DNS can't look up addresses (the network itself works)
DNS 查不到網址	DNS can't look up addresses
查詢 %s 失敗。	Looking up %s failed.
目前的 DNS 伺服器：%s	Current DNS servers: %s
這看起來是公司或學校的網路（網域 %s），請聯絡網管人員；不要自己改 DNS，不然內部網站會連不到。	This looks like a company or school network (domain %s). Contact your network administrator; don't change the DNS yourself, or internal websites will stop working.
可以改用公共 DNS（Cloudflare 1.1.1.1 與 Google 8.8.8.8），之後隨時可以改回自動。	You can switch to public DNS (Cloudflare 1.1.1.1 and Google 8.8.8.8) and switch back to automatic at any time.
改用公共 DNS	Use public DNS
重新啟動路由器；還是不行請聯絡網路業者。	Restart the router. If that doesn't help, contact your internet provider.
DNS 回應很慢（%.1f 秒）	DNS is slow to respond (%.1f s)
每打開一個新網站都要先等 DNS，網頁會感覺「卡一下才開始載入」。	Every new website has to wait for DNS first, so pages seem to pause before they start loading.
DNS 正常（%ld 毫秒）	DNS is OK (%ld ms)
DNS 伺服器：%s	DNS servers: %s
這個網路目前用公共 DNS（1.1.1.1、8.8.8.8）	This network is using public DNS (1.1.1.1, 8.8.8.8)
如果是之前在這裡設定的，網路正常後可以改回路由器給的 DNS。	If you set this here earlier, you can switch back to the router's DNS once the network is working.
改回自動	Switch back to automatic
這個網路要先在網頁上登入	This network requires signing in on a web page
飯店、咖啡店、機場的 Wi-Fi 常常要先同意條款或輸入房號才能上網。	Hotel, café and airport Wi-Fi often asks you to accept terms or enter a room number before you can go online.
開啟登入頁	Open sign-in page
可以連上網際網路	The internet is reachable
網路是通的，但因為 DNS 壞了，打不開網站	The network works, but websites won't open because DNS is broken
見上面 DNS 那一項。	See the DNS item above.
連得到路由器，但連不到網際網路	The router is reachable, but the internet isn't
問題在路由器之外：路由器沒有連上網路業者，或業者那邊斷線。	The problem is beyond the router: either the router isn't connected to your internet provider, or the provider has an outage.
把路由器（和數據機）拔掉電源 30 秒再插回去；還是不行請聯絡網路業者，看看是不是有斷線公告。	Unplug the router (and modem) for 30 seconds, then plug them back in. If that doesn't help, contact your internet provider to check for a reported outage.
VPN「%s」連線中	VPN “%s” is connected
網路流量會先經過 VPN；網路慢或有些網站打不開時，可以先中斷 VPN 比較看看。	Network traffic goes through the VPN first. If the network is slow or some websites won't open, try disconnecting the VPN to compare.
有設定 Proxy（代理伺服器）	A proxy server is set
程式的連線會經過它；Proxy 停擺時網頁會打不開。	Programs connect through it; if the proxy goes down, web pages won't open.
有 IPv6	IPv6 available
沒有 IPv6（大部分網站都不影響）	No IPv6 (doesn't affect most websites)
重新啟動網路服務（NetworkManager），網路會中斷幾秒。	Restart the network service (NetworkManager). The network will drop for a few seconds.
打開 Wi-Fi。	Turn on Wi-Fi.
重新連線「%s」，網路會中斷幾秒。	Reconnect “%s”. The network will drop for a few seconds.
讓「%s」改用公共 DNS（1.1.1.1、8.8.8.8），並重新連線一次。之後可以在這裡或網路設定改回自動。	Switch “%s” to public DNS (1.1.1.1, 8.8.8.8) and reconnect once. You can switch back to automatic here or in Network settings later.
讓「%s」改回使用路由器給的 DNS，並重新連線一次。	Switch “%s” back to the router's DNS and reconnect once.
用瀏覽器打開一個網頁，Wi-Fi 的登入頁會自己跳出來。	Open a web page in the browser; the Wi-Fi sign-in page will appear on its own.
正在安裝或更新軟體	installing or updating software
正在自動安裝安全性更新	automatically installing security updates
正在檢查或安裝更新	checking for or installing updates
正在檢查更新	checking for updates
Snap 正在更新	updating Snap apps
正在建立檔案索引	indexing files
正在檢查韌體更新	checking for firmware updates
小柚的 AI 模型正在思考	running Pomi's AI model
正在掃描病毒	scanning for viruses
正在轉檔或錄影	converting or recording video
正在更新說明文件索引	updating the manual page index
CPU 很忙（整體 %.0f%%）	The CPU is busy (%.0f%% overall)
用最多的程式：%s（一顆核心＝100%%，這台有 %ld 顆）	Top programs: %s (one core = 100%%; this computer has %ld cores)
背景%s，做完就會恢復。	In the background: %s. Things will speed up again once it's done.
不認得或不需要的程式可以關掉；網頁瀏覽器開太多分頁也很吃 CPU。	You can close programs you don't recognize or don't need. Lots of open browser tabs also use a lot of CPU.
結束這個程式	End this program
CPU 不忙（%.0f%%）	The CPU isn't busy (%.0f%%)
用最多的程式：%s	Top programs: %s
背景%s	In the background: %s
這段時間電腦會比較慢，做完就會恢復。	The computer may be slower meanwhile; it will speed up again once it's done.
記憶體快用完了（剩 %s／%s）	Memory is almost full (%s free of %s)
關掉不用的程式與瀏覽器分頁；常常這樣的話，加記憶體會有很明顯的改善。	Close programs and browser tabs you aren't using. If this happens often, adding more memory will make a big difference.
記憶體有點緊（剩 %s／%s）	Memory is a bit tight (%s free of %s)
已經在用硬碟當記憶體（Swap 用了 %.0f%%），所以會變慢。	The disk is already being used as memory (Swap %.0f%% used), which slows things down.
關掉不用的程式與瀏覽器分頁。	Close programs and browser tabs you aren't using.
記憶體足夠（剩 %s／%s）	Enough memory (%s free of %s)
硬碟忙不過來	The disk can't keep up
過去 10 秒有 %.0f%% 的時間，程式在等硬碟。	In the last 10 seconds, programs spent %.0f%% of the time waiting for the disk.
可能是正在複製大檔案、更新，或記憶體不夠而一直用到 Swap。	It may be copying large files or updating, or constantly using Swap because memory is low.
硬碟不忙	The disk isn't busy
系統裝在傳統硬碟上	The system is installed on a traditional hard drive
開機、開程式、更新都會比較慢；換成 SSD 是讓電腦變快最有效的方法。	Starting up, opening programs and updating are all slower. Switching to an SSD is the most effective way to speed up the computer.
CPU 過熱，正在降速	The CPU is overheating and slowing down
CPU 很燙	The CPU is very hot
目前 %.0f°C。	Currently %.0f°C.
清一下風扇與通風口的灰塵；筆電放在硬的桌面上，不要放在棉被或腿上。	Clean the dust out of the fan and vents. Put the laptop on a hard surface, not on a blanket or your lap.
CPU 溫度正常（%.0f°C）	CPU temperature is normal (%.0f°C)
目前是省電模式	Power saver mode is on
省電模式會讓 CPU 跑慢一點，換取比較長的電池時間。	Power saver mode runs the CPU a bit slower in exchange for longer battery life.
改成平衡模式	Switch to Balanced mode
最近 7 天有 %d 次記憶體不夠，系統強制結束了程式	In the last 7 days, the system force-closed programs %d time(s) because memory ran out
被結束的程式：%s	Programs that were closed: %s
同時開的程式太多、或某個程式用掉太多記憶體；可以加記憶體或開啟 zram。	Too many programs were open at once, or one program used too much memory. You can add more memory or turn on zram.
有 %d 個已經結束、但還沒被收走的程序（殭屍程序）	%d finished process(es) not yet cleaned up (zombie processes)
它們幾乎不佔資源；數量一直增加的話，是產生它們的程式有問題，重新啟動那個程式就會清掉。	They use almost no resources. If the number keeps growing, the program that creates them has a problem; restarting that program clears them.
結束「%s」（PID %s）。還沒儲存的內容會不見。	End “%s” (PID %s). Any unsaved work will be lost.
改成平衡模式。	Switch to Balanced mode.
遠端桌面（RDP）	Remote Desktop (RDP)
VNC 的密碼與畫面常常沒有加密	VNC passwords and screen contents are often unencrypted
Telnet 完全沒有加密，帳號密碼會被看光	Telnet isn't encrypted at all; usernames and passwords can be read in plain text
FTP 沒有加密，帳號密碼會被看到	FTP isn't encrypted; usernames and passwords can be seen
Docker 管理介面（沒有加密）	Docker management interface (unencrypted)
任何連得到這個埠的人都能完全控制這台電腦	Anyone who can reach this port can take full control of this computer
Redis 預設沒有密碼，常被拿來入侵	Redis has no password by default and is often used to break in
資料庫直接開放給網路，常被勒索刪資料	The database is open to the network; such databases are often wiped for ransom
沒有密碼保護，也會被拿來攻擊別人	No password protection; it can also be used to attack others
資料庫直接開放給網路	The database is open to the network
Windows 檔案分享（SMB）	Windows file sharing (SMB)
資料夾分享出去了；確認只在信任的網路上	Folders are shared; make sure this is only on trusted networks
NFS 用的服務，通常不需要開放	A service used by NFS; usually doesn't need to be open
印表機分享（CUPS）	Printer sharing (CUPS)
網頁伺服器	Web server
管理介面直接開放給網路	The management interface is open to the network
已知的挖礦程式	known cryptocurrency miner
從暫存資料夾執行	running from a temporary folder
名稱偽裝成系統核心的程式	name disguised as a kernel process
找到 %d 個可疑的程式	Found %d suspicious program(s)
如果你不認得它們，請把電腦拔掉網路，再請懂電腦的人或資安人員協助檢查；不要直接刪除，先保留證據。	If you don't recognize them, disconnect the computer from the network and ask someone who knows computers or a security professional to check it. Don't delete anything yet; keep the evidence.
沒有發現可疑的程式	No suspicious programs found
暫存資料夾裡有 %d 個可以執行的檔案	%d executable file(s) in temporary folders
有些安裝程式會這樣做；不認得的話值得留意（惡意程式常放在這裡）。	Some installers do this, but keep an eye on files you don't recognize (malware often hides here).
背景服務	background service
有程式會從暫存資料夾自動執行	A program runs automatically from a temporary folder
這很可能是惡意程式留下的；請協助檢查並移除。	This was most likely left by malware. Please have it checked and removed.
登入時會自動執行 %d 個你（或你裝的程式）加的項目	%d item(s) added by you (or programs you installed) run automatically at login
看一下有沒有不認得的；系統與 Pomelo 內建的不列在這裡。	Check for any you don't recognize. Built-in system and Pomelo items aren't listed here.
沒有額外的自動執行項目	No extra startup items
找不到帳號檢查程式（pomelo-system 的一部分）	Account check program not found (part of pomelo-system)
沒有取得管理員權限，略過帳號與系統設定的檢查	No administrator permission; skipping the account and system configuration checks
有 %d 個帳號沒有設密碼	%d account(s) without a password
請替這些帳號設定密碼（終端機：sudo passwd 帳號名稱），或把不用的帳號鎖起來。	Set passwords for these accounts (in Terminal: sudo passwd username), or lock accounts you don't use.
每個帳號都有密碼	Every account has a password
有 %d 個帳號的密碼用舊的方式加密	%d account(s) with passwords stored using old encryption
重新設定一次密碼，就會改用新的加密方式。	Setting the password again switches it to the newer encryption.
有帳號用 sudo 不需要輸入密碼	Some accounts can use sudo without a password
設定對象：%s	Applies to: %s
只要拿到這個帳號（例如忘了鎖螢幕、或執行到惡意程式），就能直接取得系統最高權限。	Anyone who gets into this account (for example, if you forget to lock the screen or run malware) immediately gets full control of the system.
除非有特別需要，請移除 /etc/sudoers 或 /etc/sudoers.d 裡的 NOPASSWD 設定（用 sudo visudo 修改）。	Unless you really need it, remove the NOPASSWD setting from /etc/sudoers or /etc/sudoers.d (edit with sudo visudo).
使用 sudo 都要輸入密碼	sudo always asks for a password
有 %d 個不是系統套件的程式可以取得最高權限（setuid）	%d program(s) not from system packages can gain full privileges (setuid)
不認得的話請協助檢查；這是入侵者常留的後門。	If you don't recognize them, have them checked. Intruders often leave backdoors like this.
SSH 設定（見下一項）	SSH settings (see next item)
SSH 只接受金鑰登入	SSH accepts key login only
SSH 的登入設定可以更安全	SSH login settings could be more secure
改用 SSH 金鑰登入後，把 PasswordAuthentication 設成 no、PermitRootLogin 設成 no。	After switching to SSH key login, set PasswordAuthentication to no and PermitRootLogin to no.
過去 24 小時有 %d 次 SSH 登入失敗	%d failed SSH login(s) in the last 24 hours
有人在猜你的帳號密碼（網路上的自動攻擊很常見）。	Someone is guessing your username and password (automated attacks are common on the internet).
改用金鑰登入、關掉密碼登入；或用防火牆只允許信任的位址連 SSH。	Switch to key login and turn off password login, or use a firewall to allow SSH only from trusted addresses.
過去 24 小時 SSH 登入失敗 %d 次	Failed SSH logins in the last 24 hours: %d
有 %d 個安全性更新還沒裝	%d security update(s) not installed yet
另外還有 %d 個一般更新。	Plus %d regular update(s).
安全性更新修補的是已經公開的漏洞，請盡快安裝。	Security updates fix publicly known vulnerabilities. Install them as soon as possible.
開啟軟體更新	Open Software Update
有 %d 個更新可以安裝（沒有安全性更新）	%d update(s) available (no security updates)
軟體都是最新的	All software is up to date
套件清單 %ld 天沒有更新，上面的數字可能不準	The package list hasn't been refreshed in %ld day(s); the numbers above may be inaccurate
%s 對網路開放（埠 %d）	%s is open to the network (port %d)
不需要讓別的電腦連的話，請把它設定成只聽本機（127.0.0.1），或用防火牆擋住；用 Docker 開的埠不受防火牆限制，要改 Docker 的設定（例如 -p 127.0.0.1:埠:埠）。	If other computers don't need to connect, set it to listen only on this computer (127.0.0.1), or block it with a firewall. Ports opened by Docker bypass the firewall, so change the Docker settings instead (for example, -p 127.0.0.1:port:port).
有 %d 個服務可以從網路連進來	%d service(s) can be reached from the network
沒有服務對網路開放	No services are open to the network
防火牆已開啟（%s）	Firewall is on (%s)
防火牆沒有開	Firewall is off
有 %d 個服務對網路開放，同一個網路上的任何人都連得到。	%d service(s) open to the network can be reached by anyone on the same network.
目前沒有服務對網路開放，影響不大；之後裝了伺服器類的程式就需要了。	No services are open to the network right now, so this matters little. You'll need it once you install server software.
開啟防火牆	Turn on firewall
SSH 允許 root 直接用密碼登入	SSH allows root to log in directly with a password
SSH 允許空密碼登入	SSH allows login with an empty password
在 /etc/ssh/sshd_config 把 PermitRootLogin 設成 no、PermitEmptyPasswords 設成 no，再重新啟動 SSH。	In /etc/ssh/sshd_config, set PermitRootLogin to no and PermitEmptyPasswords to no, then restart SSH.
SSH 對網路開放，而且接受密碼登入	SSH is open to the network and accepts password login
網路上隨時有程式在猜 SSH 的帳號密碼。	Programs on the internet are constantly guessing SSH usernames and passwords.
改用 SSH 金鑰登入，再把 PasswordAuthentication 設成 no；或用防火牆只允許信任的位址。	Switch to SSH key login, then set PasswordAuthentication to no, or use a firewall to allow only trusted addresses.
SSH 的登入設定沒有明顯問題	No obvious problems with SSH login settings
SSH 沒有對網路開放	SSH isn't open to the network
你的帳號在 docker 群組裡（等同管理員權限）	Your account is in the docker group (equivalent to administrator rights)
docker 群組的成員不用輸入密碼，就能取得整台電腦的最高權限；執行到惡意程式時風險比較大。	Members of the docker group can gain full control of the whole computer without a password, which raises the risk if you run malware.
如果平常用得到 Docker，這是正常的；不用的話可以把自己移出 docker 群組。	If you use Docker regularly, this is normal. If not, you can remove yourself from the docker group.
你的帳號是管理員（可以用 sudo）	Your account is an administrator (can use sudo)
開機不用密碼就直接進桌面	The computer goes straight to the desktop without a password
自動登入的帳號：%s。電腦被別人拿到時，打開就能看到你的檔案。	Automatic login account: %s. If someone else gets your computer, they can see your files just by turning it on.
在系統設定的「登入畫面」關掉自動登入。	Turn off automatic login in System Settings → Login Screen.
開啟登入畫面設定	Open Login Screen settings
開機要輸入密碼	A password is required at startup
離開電腦時不會自動鎖定螢幕	The screen doesn't lock automatically when you're away
在電源設定開啟自動鎖定（建議 5～10 分鐘）；離開座位時也可以按 Super+L 鎖定。	Turn on automatic locking in Power & Lock Screen settings (5–10 minutes recommended). You can also press Super+L to lock when you leave your desk.
開啟電源設定	Open Power & Lock Screen settings
閒置 %d 分鐘才會鎖定螢幕	Screen locks only after %d minutes of inactivity
在公共場所建議改短一點（5～10 分鐘）。	In public places, a shorter time (5–10 minutes) is recommended.
閒置 %d 分鐘會自動鎖定螢幕	Screen locks automatically after %d minutes of inactivity
系統磁碟有加密	The system disk is encrypted
系統磁碟沒有加密	The system disk isn't encrypted
筆電遺失或被偷時，別人把硬碟拆下來就能讀到你所有的檔案。	If your laptop is lost or stolen, someone can remove the drive and read all your files.
電腦被拿走時，硬碟裡的檔案可以直接被讀取。	If the computer is taken, the files on its drive can be read directly.
加密要在安裝系統時選擇（重新安裝）；在那之前，重要的檔案可以放在加密的隨身碟或資料夾。	Encryption has to be chosen when installing the system (requires reinstalling). Until then, keep important files on an encrypted USB drive or in an encrypted folder.
安全開機（Secure Boot）已開啟	Secure Boot is on
安全開機（Secure Boot）沒有開	Secure Boot is off
安全開機可以防止開機程式被竄改；裝了 NVIDIA 等需要自己編譯的驅動時常需要關掉，不一定要開。	Secure Boot prevents tampering with the boot programs. It often has to be turned off for drivers you compile yourself, such as NVIDIA's, so it's optional.
AppArmor 保護已開啟	AppArmor protection is on
SELinux 保護已開啟	SELinux protection is on
SELinux 是寬容模式（只記錄、不阻擋）	SELinux is in permissive mode (logs but doesn't block)
除非正在除錯，請改回強制模式（/etc/selinux/config 的 SELINUX=enforcing）。	Unless you're debugging, switch back to enforcing mode (SELINUX=enforcing in /etc/selinux/config).
沒有 AppArmor 或 SELinux 保護	No AppArmor or SELinux protection
它們可以限制程式能做的事，被入侵時損害比較小。	They limit what programs can do, which reduces the damage if the system is broken into.
%d 把 SSH 私鑰沒有設定密碼	%d SSH private key(s) without a passphrase
檔案被偷走時，別人可以直接拿它登入你的伺服器；可以用 ssh-keygen -p -f 檔案 加上密碼。	If the file is stolen, someone can use it to log in to your servers directly. Add a passphrase with ssh-keygen -p -f file.
這台電腦的其他帳號可以看你家目錄裡的檔案	Other accounts on this computer can see the files in your home folder
家目錄權限 %o。	Home folder permissions: %o.
只讓自己看	Make private
帳號密碼與 sudo 的檢查需要管理員權限（還沒做）	Account password and sudo checks need administrator permission (not run yet)
把家目錄的權限改成只有你自己（和你的群組）能看。	Change your home folder's permissions so only you (and your group) can see it.
開啟 firewalld 防火牆，並設定成開機自動開啟。	Turn on the firewalld firewall and set it to start automatically at startup.
開啟防火牆（ufw）：別的電腦主動連進來的連線都會被擋住，你自己上網不受影響。	Turn on the firewall (ufw): incoming connections from other computers will be blocked; your own internet use isn't affected.
遠端連線用的埠（%s）會保留，不會把你自己擋在外面。	The remote access port (%s) stays open, so you won't lock yourself out.
會先安裝 ufw。	ufw will be installed first.
%s 有安裝，但沒有啟用	%s is installed but not enabled
服務：%s。不需要的話可以不用管。	Service: %s. If you don't need it, you can ignore this.
%s 啟動失敗	%s failed to start
%s 設定成開機啟動，但現在沒有在執行	%s is set to start at boot but isn't running
服務：%s（狀態：%s）	Service: %s (status: %s)
它要用的 %s 埠現在被別的程式佔用（可能是另一個網頁伺服器），所以啟動不了或被停掉了。	Port %s, which it needs, is in use by another program (maybe another web server), so it couldn't start or was stopped.
同一台電腦裝了兩個用同樣埠的伺服器；不需要 %s 的話，可以關掉它的開機啟動。	Two servers using the same port are installed on this computer. If you don't need %s, you can stop it from starting at boot.
關掉開機啟動	Don't start at boot
最後的記錄：\n%.400s	Last log entries:\n%.400s
先試著重新啟動；馬上又停掉的話，看上面的記錄或設定檔有沒有寫錯。	Try restarting it first. If it stops again right away, check the log above or the configuration file for mistakes.
%s 一直當掉又被重新啟動（%d 次）	%s keeps crashing and restarting (%d times)
用 journalctl -u %s 看它為什麼一直結束。	Use journalctl -u %s to see why it keeps stopping.
%s 在執行，但沒有在聽 %s 埠	%s is running but not listening on port %s
別的電腦（或瀏覽器）會連不上；可能是設定改了埠號，或還在啟動中。	Other computers (or browsers) can't connect. The port may have been changed in the settings, or it's still starting.
%s 正常執行（%s 埠）	%s is running normally (port %s)
%s 正常執行	%s is running normally
開機不會自動啟動。	Doesn't start automatically at boot.
網站的憑證已經過期（%s）	The website certificate has expired (%s)
瀏覽器會擋住這個網站；請更新憑證（Let's Encrypt：sudo certbot renew）。	Browsers will block this website. Renew the certificate (Let's Encrypt: sudo certbot renew).
網站的憑證再 %ld 天就過期（%s）	The website certificate expires in %ld day(s) (%s)
請盡快更新憑證；用 Let's Encrypt 的話檢查自動更新（certbot）有沒有在運作。	Renew the certificate soon. If you use Let's Encrypt, check that automatic renewal (certbot) is working.
網站的憑證到 %s	The website certificate is valid until %s
有 %d 個容器一直重新啟動或不健康	%d container(s) keep restarting or are unhealthy
在「容器」程式看它的記錄（日誌）找原因。	Check its logs in the Containers app to find the cause.
開啟容器	Open Containers
%d 個容器正常執行中	%d container(s) running normally
這台電腦沒有安裝常見的伺服器服務	No common server services are installed on this computer
重新啟動 %s。	Restart %s.
讓 %s 以後開機不要自動啟動（不會移除，之後隨時可以再開）。	Stop %s from starting automatically at boot (it won't be removed; you can turn it back on at any time).
有 %d 個服務啟動失敗	%d service(s) failed to start
不認得的服務可以先不用管；跟你正在用的功能有關的，用 systemctl status 服務名稱 看詳細原因。	You can ignore services you don't recognize. For ones related to features you use, run systemctl status service-name to see the details.
所有服務都正常啟動	All services started normally
有 %d 個服務一直當掉又被重新啟動	%d service(s) keep crashing and restarting
用 journalctl -u 服務名稱 看它為什麼一直結束。	Use journalctl -u service-name to see why it keeps stopping.
最近 30 天有 %d 次程式當掉	%d program crash(es) in the last 30 days
同一個程式一直當掉的話，請回報給我們（附上是哪個程式、做了什麼）。	If the same program keeps crashing, please report it to us (include which program and what you were doing).
最近 30 天沒有程式當掉	No program crashes in the last 30 days
讀不到系統訊息，略過磁碟錯誤的檢查（帳號要在 adm 群組）	Can't read system messages; skipping the disk error check (your account must be in the adm group)
硬碟有讀寫錯誤	The drive has read/write errors
檔案系統有錯誤	The file system has errors
本次開機以來出現 %d 次。	Occurred %d time(s) since startup.
請盡快備份重要的檔案，並到「儲存空間」看硬碟的健康狀態；硬碟可能快壞了。	Back up important files as soon as possible and check the drive's health in Storage. The drive may be about to fail.
沒有硬碟讀寫或檔案系統錯誤	No drive read/write or file system errors
CPU 或記憶體回報了硬體錯誤	The CPU or memory reported hardware errors
本次開機以來出現 %d 次。可能是記憶體或 CPU 有問題、過熱、或電壓不穩。	Occurred %d time(s) since startup. Possible causes: faulty memory or CPU, overheating, or unstable power.
如果常常當機或畫面花掉，請送修，或用 memtest 測試記憶體。	If the computer often freezes or the screen gets garbled, have it repaired, or test the memory with memtest.
上次開機花了 %.0f 秒	The last startup took %.0f seconds
最慢的步驟：%s	Slowest steps: %s
systemd-journal-flush 慢，是因為系統日誌太大（見日誌那一項）；清掉舊日誌開機就會快很多。	systemd-journal-flush is slow because the system log is too large (see the log item). Clearing old logs will make startup much faster.
開機在等網路連上；桌上型電腦通常可以關掉 NetworkManager-wait-online。	Startup is waiting for the network to connect. On desktop computers, NetworkManager-wait-online can usually be turned off.
最慢的那幾個通常就是原因；跟網路有關的（例如等網路連上）可以設定成不等。	The slowest few are usually the cause. Network-related ones (such as waiting for the network) can be set not to wait.
開機很快（%.0f 秒）	Startup is fast (%.0f seconds)
系統日誌佔了 %s	System logs use %s
日誌太大會讓開機變慢（特別是傳統硬碟），也佔空間。	Large logs slow down startup (especially on traditional hard drives) and take up space.
只保留最近的 500 MB	Keep only the latest 500 MB
/var/log 佔了 %s	/var/log uses %s
通常是某個程式一直寫錯誤訊息；在「儲存空間」的分析可以看是哪個檔案。	Usually a program keeps writing error messages. The analysis in Storage can show which file it is.
開啟儲存空間分析	Open Storage analysis
系統日誌大小正常（%s）	System log size is normal (%s)
%s 只剩 %s	%s: only %s left
磁碟滿了會讓程式當掉、更新失敗、甚至無法登入。	A full disk can make programs crash and updates fail, or even prevent you from logging in.
開啟儲存空間清理	Open Storage cleanup
%s 還有 %s	%s: %s free
時間有自動校正	The clock is set automatically
時間沒有設定成自動校正	The clock isn't set to adjust automatically
時間還沒有校正成功	The clock hasn't synchronized yet
時間不準會讓網站的安全連線失敗（憑證錯誤）、檔案時間錯亂。	An incorrect clock can make secure website connections fail (certificate errors) and mess up file times.
開啟自動校正	Turn on automatic time
已經 %ld 天沒有重新開機	Not restarted for %ld day(s)
有些更新要重新開機才會生效；長時間不關機也可能讓記憶體越來越少。	Some updates only take effect after a restart, and leaving the computer on for a long time can gradually reduce free memory.
%ld 天前開機	Started %ld day(s) ago
刪除舊的系統日誌，只保留最近的 500 MB。	Delete old system logs and keep only the latest 500 MB.
讓電腦自動從網路校正時間。	Have the computer set its clock automatically from the internet.
%s 已經停止支援了（%s）	%s is no longer supported (%s)
停止支援之後就沒有安全性更新，新發現的漏洞都不會修補。	After support ends, there are no more security updates, so newly found vulnerabilities won't be fixed.
請升級到新版本的系統，或重新安裝新版的 Pomelo 安裝光碟。	Upgrade to a newer version of the system, or reinstall from a newer Pomelo installation disc.
%s 再 %ld 天就停止支援（%s）	Support for %s ends in %ld day(s) (%s)
請開始規劃升級到新版本的系統。	Start planning an upgrade to a newer version of the system.
%s 的支援到 %s	%s is supported until %s
不知道 %s 的支援期限	Unknown end of support for %s
有 %d 個更新，其中 %d 個是安全性更新	%d update(s), including %d security update(s)
有 %d 個更新可以安裝	%d update(s) available
套件清單 %ld 天沒有更新	The package list hasn't been refreshed in %ld day(s)
電腦不知道有沒有新的更新，上面的數字可能不準。	The computer may not know about new updates, so the numbers above may be inaccurate.
