有套件沒有安裝完成	Some packages weren't fully installed
上次安裝或更新可能被中斷了（例如關機、斷電）；之後的更新也會一直失敗。	The last install or update may have been interrupted (for example, by a shutdown or power loss). Future updates will keep failing too.
