ClamAV 最擅長找 Windows 的病毒：隨身碟或下載的檔案要給 Windows 電腦用之前，先掃一下。掃描時會用掉約 1～1.5 GB 記憶體；只在你按「開始掃描」時才會執行，不會一直在背景監控。偵測率比商業防毒軟體低，只能當作多一層保護。	ClamAV is best at finding Windows viruses: scan USB drives or downloaded files before using them on a Windows computer. Scanning uses about 1–1.5 GB of memory. It only runs when you press “Start scan” and doesn't keep monitoring in the background. Its detection rate is lower than commercial antivirus software, so treat it as just an extra layer of protection.
