匯入	Import
叢集引擎是 k3s（輕量的 Kubernetes，Apache 2.0 授權），第一次建立時才下載（約 70 MB）。底下就是標準的 Kubernetes：kubectl、Helm chart、別人的 YAML 都能直接用。	The cluster engine is k3s (a lightweight Kubernetes, Apache 2.0 license). It's downloaded the first time you create a cluster (about 70 MB). Underneath it's standard Kubernetes: kubectl, Helm charts and other people's YAML all work as they are.
第 1 步：要幾台？	Step 1: how many machines?
之後隨時可以再加	You can add more any time later
叢集名稱	Cluster name
只用這台電腦	Just this computer
Server 與 Client 都裝在這台，一分鐘內能用；適合學習、開發	Server and Client are both installed on this computer, ready in under a minute; good for learning and development
多台電腦	Several computers
填每台的 IP 與 SSH 帳號，體檢後建議每台當什麼角色	Enter each machine's IP and SSH account; after the check-up, I'll recommend a role for each
會在這台電腦安裝 k3s（systemd 服務，需要管理員密碼）；不用的時候可以在叢集頁按「移除」整個拿掉。	k3s will be installed on this computer (a systemd service, needs the administrator password); when you no longer need it, press "Remove" on the cluster page to take it all out.
第 2 步：有哪些電腦？	Step 2: which computers?
每台都要能用 SSH 登入、帳號能 sudo；第一次用密碼，之後會改用金鑰	Each must be reachable by SSH, and the account must have sudo; a password is used the first time, then a key
