按「開始建立」之後會逐台安裝，大約 3～10 分鐘	After you press "Start", machines are installed one by one, in about 3 to 10 minutes
會做什麼	What will happen
最新穩定版，約 70 MB，校驗 sha256；下載到這台電腦，再送到每一台	Latest stable version, about 70 MB, verified with sha256; downloaded to this computer, then sent to each machine
取得 kubeconfig、等所有節點 Ready	Get kubeconfig and wait for all nodes to be Ready
每台：/usr/local/bin/k3s、/etc/rancher/k3s/、systemd 的 k3s 或 k3s-agent 服務；防火牆開 6443、10250、8472。	Each machine: /usr/local/bin/k3s, /etc/rancher/k3s/, the systemd service k3s or k3s-agent; the firewall opens 6443, 10250 and 8472.
