程式一啟動就結束，Kubernetes 一直重啟它。看日誌通常能知道原因（設定錯、連不到資料庫…）。	The program exits as soon as it starts, and Kubernetes keeps restarting it. The log usually tells you why (wrong settings, can't reach the database…).
