正在從 Server 讀 token…	Reading the token from the Server…
先從 Server 讀叢集的 token	First read the cluster's token from the Server
這個叢集是舊版建的，沒有存 token；讀一次之後就會記住	This cluster was created by an older version and has no saved token; it will be remembered after one read
Server 的 sudo 密碼	sudo password for the Server
讀 /var/lib/rancher/k3s/server/node-token	Reads /var/lib/rancher/k3s/server/node-token
填這台的 IP 與 SSH 帳號	Enter this node's IP and SSH account
會裝成 Client（工作節點）並加入叢集	It will be installed as a Client (worker node) and join the cluster
先體檢，沒問題再加入	Check-up first, join if there are no problems
加入叢集	Join cluster
%s：已從叢集移除，但那台的 k3s 沒拆乾淨（密碼對嗎？）	%s: removed from the cluster, but k3s on that node was not fully uninstalled (is the password right?)
節點已移除	Node removed
沒有這個應用	No such app
Redis：叢集裡 redis.pomelo-redis.svc:6379；對外是節點 IP 的 30379 埠（密碼在名片）	Redis: inside the cluster redis.pomelo-redis.svc:6379; externally port 30379 of the node IP (password is on the cluster card)
%s：叢集裡 db.pomelo-db.svc:%d；對外是節點 IP 的 %d 埠（帳號 pomelo，密碼在名片）	%s: inside the cluster db.pomelo-db.svc:%d; externally port %d of the node IP (account pomelo, password is on the cluster card)
映像庫：推送到 %s:30500/<名稱>（各節點已設定成信任它；你的電腦要在 Docker 的 insecure-registries 加上這個位址）	Image registry: push to %s:30500/<name> (nodes are already set to trust it; on your computer, add this address to Docker's insecure-registries)
靜態網站／反向代理，最簡單的試跑	Static website / reverse proxy, the simplest trial run
部落格與網站，附自己的 MariaDB	Blog and website, with its own MariaDB
自己的 Git 服務（像 GitHub），內建 SQLite	Your own Git service (like GitHub), with built-in SQLite
S3 相容的物件儲存，有網頁主控台	S3-compatible object storage with a web console
私人雲端硬碟與行事曆，附自己的 MariaDB	Private cloud drive and calendar, with its own MariaDB
監看網站有沒有掛，掛了通知	Watches whether your websites are down and notifies you
查最新版並下載 k3s	Check the latest version and download k3s
