%d 個提醒；憑證、升級、備份	Alerts: %d; certificate, upgrade, backup
告警、憑證（還有 %d 天）、升級、備份	Alerts, certificate (days left: %d), upgrade, backup
告警、憑證、升級、備份	Alerts, certificate, upgrade, backup
