升級 k3s	Upgrade k3s
%s失敗	%s failed
%s完成	%s complete
回維運	Back to Operations
有 %d 個提醒	Alerts: %d
沒有告警	No alerts
節點、Pod、磁碟區、連線憑證；有新的問題會跳通知	Nodes, Pods, volumes, connection certificate; a notification pops up when a new problem appears
背景監看：視窗關著也每 5 分鐘看一次，有新問題就通知	Background monitoring: checks every 5 minutes even when the window is closed, and notifies you of new problems
沒有 notify-send，通知只會在視窗開著時以其他方式提示	notify-send is not installed, so notifications are only shown in another way while the window is open
節點的 sudo 密碼（升級、更新憑證、備份 NFS 要用，各台要一樣）	sudo password for the nodes (needed for upgrades, renewing certificates and NFS backups; must be the same on every node)
連線憑證	Connection certificate
還有 %d 天到期	Expires in %d day(s)
kubeconfig 的用戶端憑證	Client certificate in kubeconfig
看不到到期日	Can't read the expiry date
k3s 重啟時會自動換新到期前 90 天內的憑證；這會逐台重啟 Server，再重新取得 kubeconfig	When k3s restarts, it automatically renews certificates that expire within 90 days; this restarts the Servers one by one, then gets kubeconfig again
請先填節點的 sudo 密碼	Enter the sudo password for the nodes first
到期前 90 天內才需要更新；k3s 每次啟動也會自動換新。	Renewal is only needed within 90 days of expiry; k3s also renews automatically every time it starts.
k3s 版本	k3s version
目前	Current
最新穩定版	Latest stable version
查詢中…	Checking…
查不到	Unavailable
逐台升級：Server 一台一台來，再升 Client；每台都等 Ready 才換下一台	Upgrade one by one: Servers first, one at a time, then Clients; wait for each node to be Ready before moving on to the next
升級	Upgrade
已經是最新的穩定版。	Already on the latest stable version.
正在備份…	Backing up…
正在還原…	Restoring…
把叢集的資源（應用、設定、Secret…）存成備份檔；有 NFS 儲存的話一起打包共用資料夾	Saves the cluster's resources (apps, settings, Secrets…) as a backup file; if there is NFS storage, the shared folder is packed up too
立即備份	Back up now
有 NFS 資料要備份：請先填節點的 sudo 密碼（不填的話只備份資源）	There is NFS data to back up: enter the sudo password for the nodes first (without it, only the resources are backed up)
已有的備份	Existing backups
要還原 %s 的備份嗎？	Restore backup %s?
會把備份裡的資源重新套用到叢集（同名的會被蓋掉）；NFS 資料會解開到共用資料夾	The resources in the backup will be applied to the cluster again (ones with the same name are overwritten); NFS data will be unpacked into the shared folder
備份存在 ~/.local/share/pomelo/cluster/<叢集>/backups/。資料庫這類正在寫入的資料，備份只是「某一刻的樣子」；重要的資料請另外用資料庫自己的匯出（pg_dump、mysqldump）。	Backups are stored in ~/.local/share/pomelo/cluster/<cluster>/backups/. For data that is being written to constantly, such as databases, a backup is just "a snapshot of one moment"; for important data, also use the database's own export (pg_dump, mysqldump).
叢集「%s」（k3s %s）：\n	Cluster "%s" (k3s %s):\n
這台電腦還沒有 kubectl（k3s 執行檔）：打開「容器叢集」第一次連線時會先下載。	This computer doesn't have kubectl (the k3s binary) yet: open "Container cluster" and it will be downloaded the first time you connect.
連不上：%s\n	Can't connect: %s\n
