看不到憑證到期日	Can't read the certificate expiry date
這台重啟後節點沒有回到 Ready（或版本不對）	This node didn't come back Ready after the restart (or the version is wrong)
需要注意的事	Things that need attention
背景監看（視窗關著也每 5 分鐘看一次）	Background monitoring (checks every 5 minutes even when the window is closed)
有新的問題就跳通知，同一個問題不會重複吵你。	You get a notification when a new problem appears, and the same problem won't nag you twice.
沒有 notify-send，通知跳不出來；請安裝 libnotify-bin。	notify-send is missing, so notifications can't pop up; please install libnotify-bin.
節點的 sudo 密碼	sudo password for the nodes
升級、更新憑證、備份 NFS 資料要用（各台要一樣）；只放在記憶體，用完就清掉。	Needed for upgrades, renewing certificates and backing up NFS data (must be the same on every node); kept in memory only and cleared when done.
逐台重啟 Server，再重新取得 kubeconfig	Restart the Servers one by one, then get kubeconfig again
k3s 重啟時會自動換新到期前 90 天內的憑證。	When k3s restarts, it automatically renews certificates that expire within 90 days.
升到最新穩定版	Upgrade to the latest stable version
逐台升級：Server 一台一台來，再升 Client；每台都等到真的回來、版本對了才換下一台。	Upgrade one by one: Servers first, one at a time, then Clients; each node must be back and on the right version before the next one starts.
備份叢集的資源與 NFS 資料	Back up the cluster's resources and NFS data
還原備份	Restore backup
備份包含應用、設定、Secret，以及有 NFS 儲存時共用資料夾裡的資料。存在 ~/.local/share/pomelo/cluster/<叢集>/backups/。資料庫這類正在寫入的資料，備份只是「某一刻的樣子」；重要的資料請另外用資料庫自己的匯出（pg_dump、mysqldump）。	A backup includes apps, settings, Secrets, and, if there is NFS storage, the data in the shared folder. Backups are stored in ~/.local/share/pomelo/cluster/<cluster>/backups/. For data that is being written to constantly, such as databases, a backup is just "a snapshot of one moment"; for important data, also use the database's own export (pg_dump, mysqldump).
