建好之後可以匯出 kubeconfig	You can export the kubeconfig once it's created
請先填帳號名稱	Enter an account name first
帳號是 pomelo-users 命名空間裡的 ServiceAccount，權限用 Kubernetes 內建的 view／edit／admin 角色綁定；整個叢集的管理員是 cluster-admin。全部是標準物件，kubectl 看得到、也能自己改。	Accounts are ServiceAccounts in the pomelo-users namespace. Permissions use Kubernetes' built-in view/edit/admin roles through bindings; cluster-wide admin is cluster-admin. All are standard objects that kubectl can show and you can edit yourself.
正在同步…	Syncing…
抓倉庫、套用到叢集	Fetch the repository and apply it to the cluster
上次同步：%s　%s	Last sync: %s　%s
叢集跟著 Git 倉庫走	Cluster follows a Git repository
把部署檔放在 Git，改了就同步到叢集；有紀錄、可以回復	Keep manifests in Git and sync changes to the cluster; with history and rollback
倉庫	Repository
倉庫網址	Repository URL
分支（留空＝預設分支）	Branch (empty = default branch)
資料夾（留空＝整個倉庫）	Folder (empty = whole repository)
自動同步（背景監看每 5 分鐘看一次，有新的提交才套用）	Auto sync (checks in the background every 5 minutes; applies only when there are new commits)
儲存設定	Save settings
儲存並立即同步	Save and sync now
請先填倉庫網址	Enter the repository URL first
倉庫裡放標準的 Kubernetes YAML（可以分很多檔、放子資料夾）；有 kustomization.yaml 就用 kustomize。私有倉庫：網址寫成 https://帳號:token@主機/…，或用 SSH 網址（要先把這台電腦的 SSH 金鑰加到倉庫）。同步只會新增與更新，不會刪掉倉庫裡已經拿掉的東西。	Put standard Kubernetes YAML in the repository (any number of files, subfolders allowed); if there is a kustomization.yaml, kustomize is used. Private repository: write the URL as https://user:token@host/…, or use an SSH URL (add this computer's SSH key to the repository first). Sync only adds and updates; it does not delete things removed from the repository.
