「小柚（會長大）」現在是柚子果；你跟牠對話 %d 次了，滿 %d 次牠會長成小女孩，滿 %d 次會再長成成年。	"小柚 (grows up)" is currently a pomelo fruit. You have chatted %d times; at %d times it will grow into a little girl, and at %d times it will grow into an adult.
「小柚（會長大）」現在是小女孩（你們對話了 %d 次）；滿 %d 次會再長大一次。	"小柚 (grows up)" is currently a little girl (you have chatted %d times); at %d times it will grow up once more.
「小柚（會長大）」已經長成成年了（你們對話了 %d 次）。	"小柚 (grows up)" has fully grown up (you have chatted %d times).
這個樣式是固定的，不會長大；想看牠長大請選「小柚（會長大）」。	This style is fixed and does not grow; to watch it grow, choose "小柚 (grows up)".
