再依照的欄由大到小	Descending for the second column
起始值和間隔要是數字，間隔不能是 0。	The start value and step must be numbers, and the step cannot be 0.
終止值要是數字。	The stop value must be a number.
間隔的正負號跟終止值對不上，永遠到不了。	The sign of the step does not match the stop value; it would never get there.
請先選好要填的範圍，或是填上終止值。	Select the range to fill first, or enter a stop value.
一次最多填 100000 格。	At most 100000 cells can be filled at once.
要有兩列以上的資料才能排序。	Sorting needs at least two rows of data.
排序的欄要在範圍之內。	The sort column must be inside the range.
