先暫停應用再複製（資料較一致，複製完自動恢復）	Pause the app before copying (more consistent data, resumed automatically afterwards)
會把應用的設定存在這台電腦，並把每個磁碟區整份複製成一個新的磁碟區（多占一份空間）。資料庫這類正在寫入的資料，建議保持「先暫停」。	The app's settings are saved on this computer, and each volume is fully copied into a new volume (uses extra space). For data being written, such as databases, keep "Pause first" on.
這個應用沒有磁碟區，只存設定。	This app has no volumes; only its settings are saved.
