關掉的話，只有 VPN 內部的網路經過 VPN，其他照舊走原本的網路。WireGuard 要設定檔的 AllowedIPs 有 0.0.0.0/0 才會把所有流量導進來。	When off, only the VPN's own network goes through the VPN and everything else uses your normal connection. For WireGuard, the AllowedIPs in the configuration must include 0.0.0.0/0 to route everything.
