連上了，但服務的回應格式不是預期的。請確認服務類型與網址。	Connected, but the service's response was not in the expected format. Please check the service type and address.
金鑰的格式不對（只能是英文、數字與符號，不能有空白）；還沒有存。	The key format is not valid (only letters, numbers and symbols, no spaces); it has not been saved.
這個網址不是 https：只有本機或內網的服務才能用 http，不然金鑰不會送出。	This address is not https: only services on this computer or your local network may use http, otherwise the key will not be sent.
服務網址要以 https:// 開頭。	The service address must start with https://.
切換到線上大腦之前	Before switching to the online brain
請先看過下面的說明，同意了才會啟用	Please read the notes below first; it is only turned on once you agree
會傳出去的資料	What is sent out
你輸入的問題、前面的對話，以及小幫手為了回答而讀到的資訊（例如檔案名稱、系統狀態、網頁內容），會傳到你選的服務商。	The questions you type, the earlier conversation, and information the assistant reads in order to answer (for example file names, system status, web page content) are sent to the service you chose.
不會傳出去的	What is not sent out
「打開終端機」「音量調到 30」這類常用指令，還是只在這台電腦上處理，不經過線上服務。小幫手不會自動附上整個檔案、剪貼簿或螢幕截圖；要讀檔案時，每一次都會先問你。	Everyday commands such as "open the terminal" or "set the volume to 30" are still handled on this computer only, without the online service. The assistant never attaches whole files, the clipboard or screenshots on its own; it asks you every time before reading a file.
你的金鑰	Your key
API 金鑰只存在這台電腦（~/.config/pomelo 底下，只有你的帳號讀得到），不會出現在命令列、日誌或錯誤訊息裡。連線一律驗證對方的憑證。	The API key is stored only on this computer (under ~/.config/pomelo, readable only by your account). It never appears on the command line, in logs or in error messages. The other side's certificate is always verified.
費用	Cost
線上服務通常按用量計費，費用由你的帳號負擔。小幫手每次回答有長度上限，工具最多連續用 8 輪，但實際花費以服務商的帳單為準。	Online services usually charge by usage, and the cost is billed to your account. Each answer has a length limit and tools run at most 8 rounds in a row, but the actual cost is whatever the provider's bill says.
隨時可以回來	You can come back any time
可以隨時在設定切回本機；切回之後，就不會再有任何東西傳出去。	You can switch back to local in Settings at any time; after that nothing is sent out anymore.
我了解了，要使用線上大腦	I understand, use the online brain
同意並啟用	Agree and turn on
先不要，繼續用本機大腦	Not now, keep using the local brain
本機（預設）	Local (default)
線上	Online
大腦	Brain
小幫手用哪一個大腦思考	Which brain the assistant thinks with
本機：問題只在這台電腦上處理，不會傳到網路上。想讓小幫手能做更多事（查資料、讀網頁…），可以切到「線上」，用自己的 API 金鑰。	Local: your questions are handled on this computer only and never sent over the network. To let the assistant do more (look things up, read web pages...), switch to "Online" and use your own API key.
線上大腦還沒有經過你的同意。	The online brain has not been approved by you yet.
看說明，同意後才會啟用	Read the notes; it turns on only after you agree
看說明	Read the notes
線上服務	Online service
API 金鑰	API key
顯示金鑰	Show key
模型名稱	Model name
自訂（用上面填的名稱）	Custom (use the name entered above)
