進階：自訂服務網址	Advanced: custom service address
服務網址	Service address
OpenAI 相容：OpenAI、OpenRouter、Groq、DeepSeek、Together，或自己架的 Ollama、LM Studio、vLLM 都可以，把服務網址換成它們的（例如 http://localhost:11434/v1，自己架的可以不填金鑰）。	OpenAI-compatible: OpenAI, OpenRouter, Groq, DeepSeek, Together, or your own Ollama, LM Studio or vLLM all work; replace the service address with theirs (for example http://localhost:11434/v1; self-hosted ones can leave the key empty).
測試連線	Test connection
測試中…	Testing...
送一個很短的請求，確認金鑰和網路都正常	Send one very short request to check that the key and network work
線上對話	Online chat
邊想邊顯示（串流）	Show the answer as it is written (streaming)
連不上網路時，自動改用本機大腦	Switch to the local brain automatically when the network is unreachable
允許小幫手執行指令（進階，每次都會讓你確認）	Allow the assistant to run commands (advanced; you confirm every time)
線上服務通常按用量計費，費用由你的帳號負擔。每次回答有長度上限，工具最多連續用 8 輪。傳出去的內容只有你的問題與小幫手需要的資訊；讀檔案、讀陌生網址都會先問你，高風險的動作（安裝套件、關機、寫檔、執行指令）一定要你按確認。	Online services usually charge by usage, and the cost is billed to your account. Each answer has a length limit and tools run at most 8 rounds in a row. Only your question and what the assistant needs are sent; reading files and unfamiliar web addresses always asks you first, and risky actions (installing packages, shutting down, writing files, running commands) always need your confirmation.
OpenAI 相容	OpenAI-compatible
