Google Gemini	Google Gemini
已取消。	Cancelled.
連不上網路，或找不到服務的網址。請檢查網路，也可以到設定把大腦切回本機。	Cannot reach the network, or the service address was not found. Please check your network, or switch the brain back to local in Settings.
等了太久，服務沒有回應（逾時）。可以稍後再試，或到設定把大腦切回本機。	Waited too long and the service did not respond (timeout). Try again later, or switch the brain back to local in Settings.
無法確認對方的身分（憑證不被信任或已過期），為了安全已經中止，沒有送出任何資料。	Could not verify the other side's identity (the certificate is untrusted or expired). To be safe, it was stopped and nothing was sent.
服務網址不正確，或不是 https 網址。請到設定檢查。	The service address is not valid, or it is not an https address. Please check it in Settings.
找不到 curl，請先安裝 curl。	curl was not found; please install curl first.
回應太大，已經中止。	The response was too large and was stopped.
連線失敗了，請稍後再試，或到設定把大腦切回本機。	The connection failed. Please try again later, or switch the brain back to local in Settings.
金鑰不對、已失效，或沒有使用這個模型的權限（%d）。請到小幫手設定檢查 API 金鑰。	The key is wrong, has expired, or has no permission to use this model (%d). Please check the API key in the assistant's Settings.
找不到這個模型或服務網址（404）。請檢查模型名稱與網址。	The model or service address was not found (404). Please check the model name and address.
額度用完了，或請求太頻繁（429）。請稍後再試，或到服務商的帳號頁面檢查額度。	The quota is used up, or there are too many requests (429). Please try again later, or check your quota on the provider's account page.
服務商那邊暫時出了問題（%d），請稍後再試。	The provider is having a temporary problem (%d). Please try again later.
服務商拒絕了這個請求（%d）	The provider rejected the request (%d)
