# 主機醫生（pomelo-doctor）
秒	sec
從來沒有	Never
剛剛	Just now
%ld 分鐘前	%ld min ago
%ld 小時前	%ld hr ago
%ld 天前	%ld days ago
預測	Forecast
平常 %s	Usually %s
pomelo-doctor — 主機醫生：體檢歷史與趨勢、為什麼變慢、安全總覽	pomelo-doctor — Host Doctor: checkup history and trends, why it's slow, security overview
用法：pomelo-doctor [選項]（沒有選項就開視窗）	Usage: pomelo-doctor [options] (with no options, opens the window)
採樣一次（讀幾個數字就結束；給排程與登入用）。--force 不管上次採樣的時間	Take one sample (reads a few numbers and exits; for the scheduler and login). --force ignores the time of the last sample
完整體檢（八類，可能要幾分鐘）並記進歷史	Full checkup (eight categories, may take a few minutes) and record it in the history
為什麼變慢：找出最可能的原因與建議。--boot 一併分析開機	Why is it slow: find the most likely causes and suggestions. --boot also analyzes startup
安全總覽：連線、登入、防火牆、權限與風險分數。--admin 也跑需要管理員權限的部分	Security overview: connections, logins, firewall, permissions and risk score. --admin also runs the parts that need administrator rights
看最近幾天的趨勢與預測（預設 30 天）	Show trends and forecasts for the last few days (default 30 days)
匯出報告（HTML；檔名結尾是 .pdf 就輸出 PDF）。--anonymize 去識別化	Export a report (HTML; if the file name ends in .pdf, PDF is produced). --anonymize removes identifying details
把趨勢圖存成 PNG（指標：disk mem swap boot load temp bat upd failed）	Save a trend chart as PNG (metrics: disk mem swap boot load temp bat upd failed)
簡短輸出（給小幫手用：只有數字與行程名稱）	Brief output (for the assistant: numbers and process names only)
以 JSON 輸出	Output as JSON
開視窗並直接進入某一頁（overview trend diagnose security settings）	Open the window directly on a page (overview trend diagnose security settings)
顯示這個說明	Show this help
資料只存在本機（~/.local/share/pomelo/doctor/），不會上傳。	Data is stored only on this computer (~/.local/share/pomelo/doctor/) and is never uploaded.
