監聽中的埠：%d 個（看不到行程名稱的連線：%d 條，需要管理員權限）\n	Listening ports: %d (connections without a visible process name: %d; administrator rights needed)\n
沒有發現需要處理的問題。	No issues need attention.
為什麼重要：	Why it matters:
有幾項檢查需要管理員權限而略過；加上 --admin 會要求輸入管理員密碼後再掃一次（只讀）。	Some checks need administrator rights and were skipped; adding --admin asks for the administrator password and scans again (read-only).
處理器 %.0f%%、I/O 等待 %.0f%%、可用記憶體 %.0f%%\n	Processor %.0f%%, I/O wait %.0f%%, available memory %.0f%%\n
目前看不出明顯的原因。	No obvious cause at the moment.
（已跟你這台電腦的歷史比較）	(Compared with this computer's history)
（還沒有歷史，沒有跟平常比較；先採樣幾天就會有）	(No history yet, so no comparison with normal; sample for a few days and it will appear)
採樣完成。	Sampling done.
採樣失敗：無法寫入歷史資料夾	Sampling failed: cannot write to the history folder
