更新套件 %s%s	Update package %s%s
移除套件 %s%s	Remove package %s%s
核心換版：%s → %s	Kernel changed: %s → %s
失敗的服務變成：%s%s	Failed services became: %s%s
先前失敗的服務（%s）已經恢復%s	Previously failed services (%s) have recovered%s
會請「%s」（編號 %d）正常結束。它還沒存檔的資料會遺失。	Will ask "%s" (ID %d) to quit normally. Its unsaved data will be lost.
會重新啟動服務 %s。需要管理員權限。	Will restart the service %s. Administrator rights needed.
會停用 %s（下次開機不再等待它；要還原時執行 systemctl enable %s）。	Will disable %s (it will no longer be waited for at next startup; to undo, run systemctl enable %s).
會刪掉最舊的日誌，只留 500 MB。已經刪掉的日誌無法復原。	Will delete the oldest logs and keep only 500 MB. Deleted logs cannot be recovered.
會啟用 ufw：預設擋掉所有進來的連線。如果你正在用 SSH 遠端連線，請先放行 22 埠，否則連線會中斷。	Will enable ufw: all incoming connections are blocked by default. If you are connected over SSH, allow port 22 first, or the connection will drop.
會關閉 ufw，所有埠都不再受防火牆保護。	Will turn off ufw; no port will be protected by the firewall.
會讓 %s 可以從外面連進來。	Will allow %s to be reached from outside.
會擋掉從外面連到 %s 的連線。	Will block connections to %s from outside.
會在 firewalld 放行 %s（永久）。	Will allow %s in firewalld (permanent).
會在 firewalld 移除 %s 的放行（永久）。	Will remove the allowance for %s in firewalld (permanent).
會啟用並啟動 firewalld（預設只放行 SSH 等少數服務）。	Will enable and start firewalld (by default it only allows SSH and a few other services).
會安裝 %s（防火牆）。安裝後再回來按「啟用防火牆」。	Will install %s (firewall). After installing, come back and click "Enable Firewall".
可信度 %d%%	Confidence %d%%
診斷	Diagnose
正在診斷…	Diagnosing…
重新診斷	Diagnose Again
開始診斷	Start Diagnosis
一併分析開機	Also analyze startup
電腦怎麼突然變慢了？	Why did the computer suddenly slow down?
按「開始診斷」：會花約 1 秒量一次處理器、記憶體、硬碟讀寫、溫度、背景工作與服務，\n再跟這台電腦自己的歷史比較，列出最可能的原因（依可信度排序）和建議。\n診斷只讀系統資訊，不會改任何設定；要修正的地方都會先問你。	Click "Start Diagnosis": it spends about 1 second measuring the processor, memory, disk activity, temperature, background jobs and services,\nthen compares them with this computer's own history and lists the most likely causes (ranked by confidence) with suggestions.\nDiagnosis only reads system information and changes no settings; anything to fix will ask you first.
正在量測…	Measuring…
處理器與硬碟讀寫要量一小段時間，請稍等一下。	The processor and disk activity need a short while to measure. Please wait.
現在的狀況	Current state
硬碟等待	Disk wait
記憶體使用	Memory use
負載（核心數 ×1 是滿載）	Load (number of cores ×1 is full load)
已跟這台電腦的歷史比較（%d 筆採樣、%d 天）	Compared with this computer's history (%d samples, %d days)
還沒有歷史資料，沒有跟平常比較；每天自動採樣，過幾天就會有	No history yet, so no comparison with normal; sampling runs daily and it will appear in a few days
目前看不出明顯的原因	No obvious cause at the moment
處理器、記憶體、硬碟、溫度、背景工作與服務都在正常範圍。如果還是覺得慢，請在慢的時候再診斷一次。	Processor, memory, disk, temperature, background jobs and services are all in the normal range. If it still feels slow, diagnose again while it is slow.
排序依「可信度 × 嚴重度」；證據只含數字與行程名稱，沒有命令列與路徑。	Ranked by "confidence × severity"; evidence contains only numbers and process names, no command lines or paths.
