setuid 與 SSH 金鑰是「跟第一次掃描的基準比」：第一次執行會把當時的狀態記為基準（信任當下），之後有新增才會提醒。	setuid programs and SSH keys are "compared with the baseline from the first scan": the first run records the current state as the baseline (trusting it as is), and later additions are reported.
