讀取連線、登入紀錄、防火牆與設定，也會用本機的漏洞資料比對套件。	Reads connections, login history, firewall and settings, and also matches packages against local vulnerability data.
看看這台電腦有沒有安全上的破口	See whether this computer has any security gaps
按「開始掃描」：列出對外開放的服務、誰連進來、登入與失敗紀錄、防火牆狀態，\n檢查 SSH 設定與重要位置的權限，並併入套件的已知漏洞與病毒掃描結果，算出一個風險分數。\n全部在本機進行，不會連網；需要管理員權限的部分會另外問你。	Click "Start Scan": it lists the services open to the network, who connects in, logins and failed logins, and the firewall state,\nchecks the SSH settings and permissions of important locations, adds known package vulnerabilities and virus scan results, and calculates a risk score.\nEverything happens on this computer without going online; anything that needs administrator rights is asked about separately.
