放行	Allow
放行的埠：%s。	Allowed ports: %s.
ufw 已啟用（規則內容要管理員權限才看得到）。	ufw is enabled (the rules can only be seen with administrator rights).
firewalld 執行中。	firewalld is running.
nftables 服務執行中（規則內容要管理員權限才看得到）。	The nftables service is running (the rules can only be seen with administrator rights).
核心載入了 iptables（規則內容要管理員權限才看得到）。	The kernel has iptables loaded (the rules can only be seen with administrator rights).
沒有偵測到任何防火牆。	No firewall detected.
有 %d 把新的 SSH 金鑰（authorized_keys）	%d new SSH keys (authorized_keys)
新增：%s%s	New: %s%s
有了金鑰，持有的人不用密碼就能登入你的帳號。不是你加的就要警覺。	With a key, whoever holds it can log in to your account without a password. Be alert if you didn't add it.
確認是自己加的；不是的話刪掉 ~/.ssh/authorized_keys 裡那一行，並檢查有沒有被入侵。	Make sure you added it; if not, delete that line in ~/.ssh/authorized_keys and check whether the system was compromised.
%d 個服務對所有網路開放	%d services open to all networks
監聽中：%s	Listening: %s
對所有網路開放的服務，同一個網路（甚至整個網際網路）上的人都有機會連進來；每多一個就多一個被攻擊的入口。	Services open to all networks can be reached by people on the same network (or even the whole Internet); each one adds another way in for attackers.
防火牆有開，只要確認真的需要這些服務；不需要的就停掉。	The firewall is on; just make sure you really need these services, and stop the ones you don't.
不需要的服務就停掉；需要的就開防火牆，只放行必要的埠。	Stop services you don't need; for the ones you do, turn on the firewall and allow only the necessary ports.
防火牆（ufw）沒有啟用	Firewall (ufw) is not enabled
　而且有服務對所有網路開放。	  and some services are open to all networks.
防火牆是最後一道門：就算某個程式不小心聽了埠，沒有放行的連線也進不來。	The firewall is the last door: even if a program accidentally listens on a port, connections that aren't allowed can't get in.
啟用 ufw（預設擋掉進來的連線）。啟用前請先確認 SSH 的 22 埠有放行，否則遠端連線會斷。	Enable ufw (blocks incoming connections by default). Before enabling, make sure SSH port 22 is allowed, or remote connections will drop.
安裝並啟用 ufw（Ubuntu、Debian）或 firewalld（Fedora、Rocky）；只放行需要的服務。	Install and enable ufw (Ubuntu, Debian) or firewalld (Fedora, Rocky); allow only the services you need.
有人在猜你的密碼（暴力破解）	Someone is guessing your passwords (brute force)
%s 在 24 小時內失敗 %d 次（全部來源共 %d 次）	%s failed %d times within 24 hours (%d times from all sources)
機器人會到處試常見的帳號與密碼；密碼不夠強、又允許密碼登入的話，遲早會被猜中。	Bots try common accounts and passwords everywhere; if a password is weak and password login is allowed, it will be guessed sooner or later.
SSH 改成只用金鑰登入、不要對網際網路開放 22 埠，或用防火牆限制來源；可以考慮安裝 fail2ban 自動封鎖。	Make SSH use keys only, don't expose port 22 to the Internet, or limit sources with the firewall; consider installing fail2ban to block automatically.
過去 24 小時有 %d 次登入失敗	%d failed logins in the past 24 hours
最多的來源：%s（%d 次）	Top source: %s (%d times)
失敗次數突然變多，通常表示有人在試密碼。	A sudden rise in failures usually means someone is trying passwords.
確認不是自己忘記密碼；不是的話檢查 SSH 設定與防火牆。	Make sure you didn't just forget your password; if not, check the SSH settings and firewall.
凌晨（0～6 點）有 %d 次成功登入	%d successful logins in the small hours (0 to 6 a.m.)
你平常不會在這個時間登入的話，可能是別人用了你的帳號。	If you don't normally log in at this time, someone else may be using your account.
到「登入紀錄」確認時間與來源是不是你自己。	Check "Login History" to see whether the times and sources are yours.
SSH 允許空白密碼登入	SSH allows login with empty passwords
沒有密碼的帳號可以直接登入，等於沒鎖門。	An account without a password can be logged into directly, which is like leaving the door unlocked.
在 sshd_config 設 PermitEmptyPasswords no。	Set PermitEmptyPasswords no in sshd_config.
SSH 允許 root 直接登入	SSH allows direct root login
；SSH 對所有網路開放	; SSH is open to all networks
root 的帳號名稱人人都知道，攻擊者只要猜中密碼就拿到整台電腦。	Everyone knows the root account name; an attacker who guesses the password gets the whole computer.
設 PermitRootLogin no（或 prohibit-password），平常用一般帳號登入再用 sudo。	Set PermitRootLogin no (or prohibit-password), log in with a normal account and use sudo.
SSH 允許用密碼登入	SSH allows password login
（沒有設定，預設是 yes）	(not set; the default is yes)
；SSH 只在區網或本機	; SSH is only on the local network or this computer
；SSH 目前沒有在執行	; SSH is not running right now
密碼可以被一直猜；金鑰幾乎猜不出來。	Passwords can be guessed again and again; keys can hardly be guessed.
先確認自己的金鑰可以登入，再把 PasswordAuthentication 設成 no。	First make sure your own key can log in, then set PasswordAuthentication to no.
%d 個重要的位置任何人都能寫入	%d important locations are writable by anyone
位置：%s	Locations: %s
任何使用者都能改這些地方，就能把惡意程式或設定放進系統，變成管理員。	If any user can change these places, they can put malware or settings into the system and become administrator.
用 chmod o-w 拿掉「其他人」的寫入權限，並找出是誰改的。	Use chmod o-w to remove write permission for "others" and find out who changed it.
~/.ssh 資料夾別人也看得到或寫得到	The ~/.ssh folder can be seen or written by others
裡面放著你的 SSH 私鑰；權限太寬，SSH 本身也會拒絕使用。	It holds your SSH private keys; if permissions are too loose, SSH itself will refuse to use them.
執行 chmod 700 ~/.ssh。	Run chmod 700 ~/.ssh.
%d 個帳號或群組用 sudo 不需要密碼	%d accounts or groups use sudo without a password
這些帳號一旦被別人用了（例如瀏覽器被入侵），就能直接取得最高權限，不會被問密碼。	If one of these accounts is taken over (for example through a compromised browser), it gets top privileges directly without being asked for a password.
沒有必要的話，用 visudo 把 NOPASSWD 拿掉。	Unless necessary, remove NOPASSWD with visudo.
%d 個帳號沒有密碼	%d accounts have no password
帳號：%s	Accounts: %s
沒有密碼的帳號，任何人都可以直接登入。	Anyone can log in directly to an account without a password.
用 passwd 帳號名稱 設定密碼，或用 passwd -l 鎖住它。	Set a password with passwd account-name, or lock it with passwd -l.
%d 個帳號已經過期但還在	%d accounts have expired but still exist
沒人在用的舊帳號沒人管，被入侵也沒人發現。	Old accounts nobody uses go unmanaged, and nobody notices if they are broken into.
不需要就用 userdel 刪掉，或確認它們不能登入。	Delete them with userdel if not needed, or make sure they cannot log in.
多了 %d 個 setuid 程式（和上次基準比）	%d more setuid programs (compared with the last baseline)
新增：%s	New: %s
setuid 程式執行時會有它擁有者（通常是 root）的權限，是攻擊者最愛的提權工具。	A setuid program runs with its owner's rights (usually root), which makes it an attacker's favorite privilege-escalation tool.
確認是你自己裝的軟體；不認得的檔案要查清楚來源，必要時用 chmod u-s 拿掉。	Make sure it is software you installed; investigate files you don't recognize, and remove the bit with chmod u-s if needed.
還沒有已知漏洞的資料，所以沒有比對套件	No known-vulnerability data yet, so packages were not compared
沒有比對，就不知道已安裝的軟體有沒有被公開的漏洞。	Without a comparison, you can't know whether installed software has publicly known vulnerabilities.
到「系統設定 → 套件清單」按「更新漏洞資料」（會連網下載一次，之後都在本機比對）。	Go to "System Settings → Package List" and click "Update Vulnerability Data" (it downloads once online; matching afterwards is done locally).
例如：%s%s；最嚴重的程度：%s	For example: %s%s; most severe level: %s
公開的漏洞，攻擊程式通常很快就有人寫出來；更新已經有了，不裝就是白白留著破口。	For public vulnerabilities, exploits are usually written quickly; an update exists, and not installing it just leaves a hole open.
安裝更新（安全性更新優先）。	Install updates (security updates first).
另有 %d 個套件有尚未修補的漏洞	%d other packages have unpatched vulnerabilities
發行版還沒釋出修正；多半要等官方更新，平常留意即可。	The distribution hasn't released a fix yet; mostly you wait for an official update, so just keep an eye on it.
沒有立即能做的事；有更新時會出現在上面那一項。	There is nothing to do right now; when an update comes it will appear in the item above.
上次病毒掃描找到 %ld 個可疑的檔案	The last virus scan found %ld suspicious files
可疑的檔案可能是病毒或惡意程式；留著它們可能被執行或傳給別人。	Suspicious files may be viruses or malware; leaving them could let them run or spread to others.
打開病毒掃描，看清單並處理（隔離或刪除）。	Open Virus Scan, review the list and deal with them (quarantine or delete).
打開病毒掃描	Open Virus Scan
交換空間使用率	Swap Usage
