依近 %.0f 天每天增加約 %.1f GB，預計約 %.0f 天後寫滿（95%% 信賴範圍：最悲觀約 %.0f 天，%s）。	At the pace of the last %.0f days (about %.1f GB more per day), it is expected to fill up in about %.0f days (95%% confidence range: worst case about %.0f days, %s).
依近 %.0f 天的成長速度，預計一年以上才會寫滿。	At the growth rate of the last %.0f days, it is expected to take more than a year to fill up.
